Property:
	Tag: [Guide, Example]

A **gym tracker** made of blocks that work together: a [[Table]] to log workouts, [[Plot]]s of the weight with its trend and of the kinds of workout, and a [[Calendar]] of the workouts. The plots and the calendar find the table by its title (*Gym log*); the plots name their axes after its columns, with units. Type a new row in the table, and the plot and the calendar follow. Back to [[Welcome]].

Table {Title: Gym log, Column: {Calorie: {Unit: kcal, Summary: Average}, Weight: {Unit: kg, Summary: Average}, Workout: {Type: Choice}}, Sort: {Date: Down}}:
	Date,Workout,Calorie,Weight
	2026-10-05,Legs,520,74.2
